# Production API (required for S3 / CloudFront builds).
# Use your Elastic Beanstalk environment URL from the AWS console (no trailing slash).
# Rebuild frontend after changing this.
#
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=http://your-env.eba-xxxx.eu-west-3.elasticbeanstalk.com
# Or if the load balancer serves HTTPS:
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://your-env.eba-xxxx.eu-west-3.elasticbeanstalk.com
#
# Local dev: leave unset; localhost uses http://localhost:3000 from src/lib/api.ts
#
# Optional: override hosted FAQ URLs (defaults in src/constants/faqDocUrls.ts).
# Production defaults: baselinefaq…/baseline-assessment-faq.html, weeklytrackerfaq…/weekly-tracker-faq.html,
# weeklytradeoff…/digital-trade-offs-swaps.html
# Local dev (Vite):
# VITE_HELP_DOC_URL=http://localhost:5173/baseline-assessment-faq.html
# VITE_WEEKLY_FAQ_DOC_URL=http://localhost:5173/weekly-tracker-faq.html
# VITE_DIGITAL_TRADE_OFFS_DOC_URL=http://localhost:5173/digital-trade-offs-swaps.html
#
# Optional: WhatsApp invite URL shown on the participant welcome page (Getting started).
# VITE_WHATSAPP_CHANNEL_URL=https://chat.whatsapp.com/Ds4TT49Batd0KV1uFnWEbL
